  ('奶茶', '我每天下午都要喝一杯＿＿。', 'Wǒ měitiān xiàwǔ dōu yào hē yì bēi nǎichá.', 'I have a cup of milk tea every afternoon.', array['杯子','吸管']::text[]),
  ('咖啡', '爸爸早上要喝＿＿才有精神。', 'Bàba zǎoshang yào hē kāfēi cái yǒu jīngshén.', 'Dad needs coffee in the morning to feel awake.', array['杯子','吸管']::text[]),
