  ('吸管', '请给我一根＿＿，我要喝椰子水。', 'Qǐng gěi wǒ yì gēn xīguǎn, wǒ yào hē yēzi shuǐ.', 'Please give me a straw; I want to drink coconut water.', array['牛奶','杯子']::text[]),
  ('牛奶', '小孩子每天早上都喝一杯＿＿。', 'Xiǎoháizi měitiān zǎoshang dōu hē yì bēi niúnǎi.', 'Children drink a glass of milk every morning.', array['吸管','热']::text[]),
