  ('新鲜', '这些水果很＿＿，是今天早上刚到的。', 'Zhèxiē shuǐguǒ hěn xīnxiān, shì jīntiān zǎoshang gāng dào de.', 'This fruit is very fresh; it only arrived this morning.', array['西瓜','袋子']::text[]),
