  ('终点站', '这辆车的＿＿是裕廊东。', 'Zhè liàng chē de zhōngdiǎnzhàn shì Yùláng Dōng.', 'The last stop of this bus is Jurong East.', array['铃','扶手']::text[]),
  ('塞车', '下雨天常常＿＿，巴士来得很慢。', 'Xiàyǔ tiān chángcháng sāichē, bāshì lái de hěn màn.', 'It often jams when it rains, so the bus comes slowly.', array['铃','终点站']::text[]),
