  ('找钱', '我给司机一百块，他要＿＿给我。', 'Wǒ gěi sījī yì bǎi kuài, tā yào zhǎoqián gěi wǒ.', 'I gave the driver a hundred dollars and he has to give me change.', array['转弯','红灯']::text[]),
